# Project rules: Base44 app

- Change only what I ask for in each message. Leave other pages and components alone.
- For anything bigger than a small change, explain the plan first and wait for my OK.
- Users can only see and change their own data unless I say otherwise.
- Secret API keys never go in front-end code.
- Keep the existing design: same colors, fonts, and components.
- If a fix fails, explain the likely cause before trying again. Don't repeat the same fix.
